flowchart
  accTitle: Network diagnosis needs discriminating evidence
  accDescr: Observed boundary evidence leads to competing predictions and a scoped observation; inconclusive evidence loops back without converting uncertainty into a root-cause claim.
O["Record observer, attempt, phase<br/>and last confirmed boundary"] --> H["State competing hypotheses<br/>with different predictions"]
  H --> E["Collect scoped evidence<br/>that can distinguish predictions"]
  E --> D{"Does it distinguish<br/>these hypotheses?"}
  D -->|yes: scoped evidence| R["Reject contradicted causes<br/>Keep scope and limits"]
  D -->|no| U["Keep uncertainty<br/>Plan next observation"]
  U --> H
